        "text_bdVDk3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The final arrivals of the Fall Collection are here, and for Part 3 we worked with our friend, artist <a href=\"https://shop.misha-and-puff.com/blogs/journal/fa26-artist-daleyden\" target=\"_blank\">Julie Daleyden</a>, to bring her beautiful artwork to fabric in a special capsule collection. </p>",
