        },
        "text_FWX7U7": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This collection is a jewel box of technique, featuring new knits, wovens, denim, and Pima. Rich in color and intricate craftsmanship, designed to create mix-and-match looks in diverse fabrications — for comfort, versatility, and dimension. Styles that feel both familiar and unexpected.</p><p>Part 2 of the Spring Collection launches Thursday, March 13 at 11 AM ET — explore, favorite, and plan your looks now.</p>",
